      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00868",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“谁假装谦虚了？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Who is pretending to be modest?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00868",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "而且，与其在你们面前装谦虚，我倒更宁愿到评论家面前去装呢。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Besides, if I were going to pretend to be modest, I would rather do it before the critics than in front of you.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00868",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我——库拉巴喀是真正的天才。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I, Kurabaka, am a true genius.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00868",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "我并不是害怕怕啰喀。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I am not afraid of Paroka.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
